./" Manpage for pope
.TH man 1 "12 June 2025" "1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
	pope - show pope (he is fleeting)
.SH SYNOPSIS
	pope [-l] [-f]
.SH DESCRIPTION
	display an eog window with the specified pope of the roman catholic church for 1.5 seconds then kill it (the window)
.SH OPTIONS
	-l for pope leo (default)\n
.br
	-f for pope francis\n
.br
	-t <time> to specify persistence of the pope, where time is a float or int
.br
	no backwards compatibility for pope benedict, etc.
.SH EXAMPLES
	pope
.br
	pope -f for pope francis (rip)
.SH BUGS
	transience lost if another instance of eog is open
